  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong dark technical art direction, disciplined cyan/yellow accents, and clear metric hierarchy make desktop feel polished. However, responsive refinement falls short of demo-ready: mobile evidence copy and metadata are extremely small and dense, long hashes wrap awkwardly, the metric card becomes vertically heavy, and the header loses the brand while exposing only a clipped horizontal nav. Tablet also has an awkward headline wrap and excessive vertical separation before the evidence panel. Several header contrast checks remain incomplete.",
    "fix": "Increase mobile supporting-text size and line height, shorten or visually truncate hashes, tighten the stacked evidence card, and replace the clipped header rail with a clearly signposted compact navigation pattern. Rebalance tablet headline width and vertical spacing, then verify header contrast on solid, testable backgrounds.",
